9.patch","merged_at":"2024-12-11T23:41:08Z"},"body":"See also https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/95762\r\n\r\nIn GDScript, `print()` prints \"**true**\" and \"**false**\".\r\nIn C#, `GD.Print()` prints \"**True**\" and \"**False**\".\r\nSo a lot of these comments in the class reference examples are _technically_ inaccurate.\r\n\r\nNote that, in the grand scheme of things, this is an _extremely_ minor change. Approve and merge this PR only if you feel like this is worth the localization needing to be refreshed.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99089/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99089/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}